{"root":{"data":{"id":"a7bfe68918ad","created":1597653171,"text":"Web API Design"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c4z4sf35mqw0","created":1597653189829,"text":"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tUse two base URLs per resource.\n\nKeep verbs out of your base URLs.\n\nUse HTTP verbs to operate on the collections and elements. \n\t\t"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c4z5i81cno80","created":1597655211951,"text":"用header来表示不同的资源，不必写在URL里\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdogs/1\n\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\tdogs/1\n\nContent-Type: application/xml\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\tdogs/1\n\nContent-Type: application/png \n\t\t","layout_mind_offset":{"x":550,"y":165}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c4z5ojuq2c00","created":1597655707856,"text":"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSupport partial response by adding optional fields in a comma delimited list.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\tUse limit and offset to make it easy for developers to paginate objects. \n\t\t\t\n\t\t","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c4z5msj1mrc0","created":1597655570013,"text":"部分返回\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t/dogs?fields=name,color,location \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\nLinkedIn\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t/people:(id,first-name,last-name,industry)\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFacebook\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t/joe.smith/friends?fields=id,name,picture\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\tGoogle\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t?fields=title,media:group(media:thumbnail) \n\t\t"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c4z5nyf3k7k0","created":1597655661199,"text":"分页\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFacebook - offset 50 and limit 25\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTwitter - page 3 and rpp 25 (records per page)\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLinkedIn - start 50 and count 25 \n\n/dogs?limit=25&offset=50 \n\t\t\t\n\t\t"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"c4z5rljaovc0","created":1597655946612,"text":"如果响应和资源无关，就应该使用动词：/convert?from=EUR&to=CNY&amount=100 \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCalculate\nTranslate\nConvert \n\t\t"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c4z5tq6a4nk0","created":1597656113437,"text":"支持多种格式的传参","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c4z5typmhi80","created":1597656132021,"text":"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tGoogle Data\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t?alt=json\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFoursquare\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t/venue.json\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\tDigg*\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\tAccept: application/json\n?type=json\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t* The type argument, if present, overrides the Accept header. \n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdogs.json\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t/dogs/1234.json \n\n\n\n\n\t\t"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"c4z5v21b9ww0","created":1597656217622,"text":"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tUse JSON as default\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFollow JavaScript conventions for naming attributes\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t- Use medial capitalization (aka CamelCase)\n\n- Use uppercase or lowercase depending on type of object \n\t\t\t\n参数命名上，小驼峰写法会比较符合js实践"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c4z6932zeqw0","created":1597657316998,"text":"当框架限制了 HTTP Method时，可以把CRUD写在参数中\nMake the method an optional parameter in the URL. \n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCreate\n\t\t\t\t\t\t/dogs?method=post\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\t\t\t/dogs\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\tUpdate\n\t\t\t\t\t\t/dogs/1234?method=put&location=park\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\tDelete\n\t\t\t\t\t\t/dogs/1234?method=delete \n\n但是通过GET删除，这样很危险"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"c4z6gqf7x7k0","created":1597657916353,"text":"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tChatty APIs\n\t\t","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c4z6gvjvmfk0","created":1597657927520,"text":"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tImagine how developers will use your API \n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBe complete and RESTful and provide shortcuts \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTake advantage of the partial response syntax \n\t\t"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"c4z6jj10v8w0","created":1597658135350,"text":"把一组文档开放成SDK（software development kits）","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"c4z6k01h7340","created":1597658172382,"text":"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSpeed adoption on a specific platform. (For example Objective C SDK for iPhone.)\nMany experienced developers are just starting off with objective C+ so an SDK might be\nhelpful.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSimplify integration effort required to work with your API - If key use cases are\ncomplex or need to be complemented by standard on-client processing.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\tAn SDK can help reduce bad or inefficient code that might slow down service for\neveryone.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\tAs a developer resource - good SDKs are a forcing function to create good source code\nexamples and documentation. Yahoo! and Paypal are good examples: \n\t\t"},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}